# Create nobody's home directory

Here /home is path to nobody's home directory.
Create nobody home directory, set mode and owner as follows.
You can do it (1) step by step, or (2) Using install command.

## nobody

```bash
sudo mkdir /home/nobody
sudo chmod u=rwx,g=rx,o= /home/nobody
sudo chown nobody:nogroup /home/nobody
# or
sudo install -m 750 -o nobody -g nogroup /home/nobody
```
